-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §151: the provisions on contributions to
-- provident funds (pension, study fund, benefits and severance) in force on
-- the eve of the signing go on for the components of pay that go on under
-- the reform.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `151`

@ref akn:art_151
GIVEN `the component goes on under the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the earlier contribution rules apply to the component` `the component goes on under the reform` IF
    `the component goes on under the reform`

#ASSERT `the earlier contribution rules apply to the component` TRUE
